	(text "USB and expansion: STM32 USB-C, Qwiic, expansion header; accelerometer, secure element, panic button; pod bus"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2c9796ff-275a-50cf-a03e-21e69fe2a302")
	)
	(text "USB-C behind a hub: the STM32 (DFU, CDC serial to the Orange Pi) and the ESP32's serial port; bench power"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "60c2561f-f5d5-566c-b154-7394885b20c2")
	)
	(text "5.1k on CC1/CC2 = sink. VBUS feeds the 5 V rail through a Schottky (bench power without a car)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "92b850a6-9a7c-5ae0-a911-232436dfb907")
	)
	(text "U18 CH334P (USB 2.0 hub, 4 ports, 2 used): port 3 is the STM32 (PA11 / PA12), port 2 the CH340C on the"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "93e6d8fa-5106-5c8e-972c-47aefb0e4930")
	)
	(text "ESP32's UART0. Both show up on the computer at once, with no firmware on either chip. (Port 3, not 1:"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e3518a5a-fb54-5b5e-be4a-c4d53899be41")
	)
	(text "ports 2 and 3 leave the chip on one side, and the upstream pair, laid by hand, has the next side alone.)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0a4a3518-2f5c-5fee-b4cc-0129a1eec0c9")
	)
	(text "The hub runs from 3V3 (V5 and VDD33 both on it, as its datasheet advises for a hub on the board), so it is"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7de81981-faab-5e25-b27e-743dd55b1d19")
	)
	(text "powered whenever the STM32 and the CH340C are: their D+ pull-ups never drive an unpowered chip. With no"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 47 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3d34907d-6568-52f0-8c8e-5b2d9b9caa88")
	)
	(text "cable in it sleeps: 0.12 mA typical, 0.4 mA at most, added to what the board draws while parked."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 50 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f72dc15c-0567-5820-a5e5-426fa82a3e03")
	)
	(text "Y2 12 MHz: the chip has load capacitors inside. (Crystal-free is an order option of the CH334, not the default.)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "51b7af84-43f6-500f-89ff-6789bd03b490")
	)
