	(text "Pod bus: switched and fused battery voltage + RS-485 for a chain of pods"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 150.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "05239b55-1064-59ec-ad5a-8b2f2472f8a5")
	)
	(text "J11 (JST GH): 1 POD_VIN, 2 RS-485 A, 3 RS-485 B, 4 GND. The adapter is one end of the chain: R77 terminates it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 157.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5929c1b7-227f-51a8-9936-16e7c61386cc")
	)
	(text "VBAT_P -> F2 (0.5 A, at the buck's input: the run across the board is fused) -> U19 -> POD_VIN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 160.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "177874e3-6737-5478-8ce5-5ef38cf966a3")
	)
	(text "U19 TPS27S100A: a high-side switch that limits the current (R72 3k: 0.82 A, 0.59-1.05 A over tolerance and"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 163.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "70303c12-35ad-5b5a-b367-3c88d51b47f6")
	)
	(text "temperature) and shuts down hot, then retries: a pod cable shorted to ground is survived, at 0.14-0.24 A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 166.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "263ddbbd-d003-5e30-a157-cced57f4dff8")
	)
	(text "for as long as POD_EN is on (firmware: off when the pods stop answering). (The discrete P-FET it replaced"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 169.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4ebff5d5-dc3b-5ee0-84c3-0fb24e8af5a1")
	)
	(text "would have burned before the polyfuse tripped: review 2026-11-24.)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 172.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fca695a8-5e58-56a9-a15c-5a93fa221749")
	)
	(text "POD_EN is PD2 (EXP_PD2 on J5) through 4.7k, off at reset (100k). Off, U19 draws under 2 uA. Its fault"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 175.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bfd7cafa-a92a-5694-b86e-b7e1a3aa17aa")
	)
	(text "flag is not connected, and the adapter cannot measure the rail. U19 is rated 40 V, 48 V for 0.4 s."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 178.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dd3b2baa-b7a3-59ba-8016-51542ab6a49e")
	)
	(text "U17 THVD2450: +-70 V on A / B (a cable pinched against POD_VIN), IEC ESD and idle-bus failsafe inside:"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 181.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9d3e24b2-d292-58e7-962c-eb594133d900")
	)
	(text "no TVS, no bias resistors. It shares USART1 with J5: DI is PC4 (EXP_TX), RO reaches PC5 (EXP_RX) through 1k,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 184.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "873b962f-2e9f-53ac-aa42-5338b9cc1093")
	)
	(text "so a USB-UART adapter on J5 still wins. DE is PA5 (100k down), RE (active low) is PC10 (100k up):"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 187.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "510da6b2-d7f8-5995-869b-731e9d0383cf")
	)
	(text "both idle = shutdown, under 1 uA, and RO floats (firmware: pull PC5 up). Listening costs 1.8 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 190.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9fc9b810-8408-52e2-9a8e-a9bb8a39401d")
	)
	(text "PC10 is USART3 TX to the system bootloader, which may toggle RE: that only switches the receiver."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.8475 193.8205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c66de465-785c-59ad-a8f6-6052b9dcbc45")
	)
